 Nm', 'body_servo': 'smart servo 12 Nm', 'body_servos_per_segment': 2, 'pcb_mass': 0.06, 'wiring_mass': 0.05, 'head_shell_mass': 0.188, 'head_payload': (('4K day camera', 0.18), ('NIR night camera', 0.12), ('LWIR', 0.09), ('microphones, IMU, radio', 0.06)), 'battery_mass': 0.444, 'compute_mass': 0.15, 'camera_x': 0.04, 'body_servo_x': 0.05, 'battery_z': -0.015, 'compute_z': 0.01, 'pcb_z': 0.025, 'foot_mu': 0.8, 'shell_mu': 0.5}\",\"robot\":\"cleopatra spring_damper\",\"sources\":{\"body connection\":\"protocol \\u00a712.1 (Amendment D, 2026-10-01): identical passive hinges (pitch, yaw, roll configurable), defaults k 8 N\\u00b7m/rad, c 0.2 N\\u00b7m\\u00b7s/rad (spring_damper; 0 in spring), q0 0 rad, limits \\u00b145\\u00b0 pitch and yaw, \\u00b120\\u00b0 roll\",\"friction\":\"protocol \\u00a71: pads 0.8 (rubber on rock), shells and head 0.5\",\"geometry\":\"designs/myropod.py with notebook 18's CLEO parameters (CLEO_MM); protocol \\u00a71\",\"leg servo\":\"actuators.py 'smart servo 6 Nm': serial-bus smart servo class, supplier datasheet; kp 40.0, kd 0.8 (protocol \\u00a71)\",\"masses\":\"notebook 18 mass budget (CAD volume x 1.1 g/cm^3, actuators.py servo masses, recorded payload); protocol \\u00a71 table\",\"placement\":\"CleopatraParams docstring (thin-walled shells, payload positions)\"}}}"
